        "cooked": "<p>Maybe Chrono's promo (Promo-Ranger?) will provide a short term benefit for boosted damage?&nbsp; Like \"Bitter Quick Shot: Destroy a hero ongoing or equipment.&nbsp; Chrono-Ranger deals a target 3 projectile damage.\"<br><br>…<br>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Oh, wait…That already happened. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>",
