      {
        "id": 131024,
        "name": "Ameena",
        "username": "Ameena",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-14T14:28:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I posted in another thread last night how insanely damaging Jim can get - if you're judging him by his base power without taking his other abilities into account, of course you're gonna think he's rubbish…but I suppose you'd think the same of, say, Fanatic as well (<span class=\"bbcode-i\">two</span> plinks of one damage!). Like I said in my other post, on his own he can managed 3+3 to a target at least twice a round. That's not weak ;).</p>\n<p>As for Unity, anything that lets her draw (or even better, play) more cards is good. Don't judge heroes by themselves - bear in mind they're always gonna be working in a team so don't think of it as \"they can't do X\", think of it as \"so-and-so is in their team which means they <span class=\"bbcode-i\">can</span> do Y\".</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
        "post_type": 1,
